{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40037","headline":"钓车 · 徐夤","name":"钓车","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荻湾渔客巧妆成，硾铸银星一点轻。\n抛过碧江鸂[鶒]岸，轧残金井辘轳声。\n轴磨騂角冰光滑，轮卷春丝水面平。\n把向严滩寻辙迹，渔台基在辗难倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}